59v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-GftmsoB2\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hTpPB2pU\">关键行为ID是优化目标external_action【关键行为】下的属性。针对某一个关键行为名称，客户可能定义为1个行为或者多个行为的组合。关键行为名称可能不是某一种具体的动作，可能是一些游戏内数值的变化。比如游戏内用户战力/经验/等级达到xxx级，或者多个数值加权拟合的指标达到xx。客户选择不同的关键行为名称，对应不同深浅的漏斗。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-od1oPICv\">当创建项目时，若选择【关键行为】优化目标，可以通过本接口获取关键行为ID，再在创建项目接口【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1740868093375503\" target=\"_blank\">创建项目</a>】接口中的optimize_goal.game_addiction_id参数进行设置</li></ol></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201813040128339107%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-RKpcZjXQ\" id=\"h346b9f0-RKpcZjXQ\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-j4AMHmLP\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/game_addiction_id/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/game_addiction_id/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1813061022952547\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-le