t返回为空[]</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">game_addiction_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-VaK9owy0\">关键行为id，由平台根据回传事件生成</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">game_addiction_name</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CDB1ddVX\">关键行为名称</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">origin_event</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vWfNmqDt\">客户在事件回传时自定义的关键行为（格式英文+数字字符串）</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">suggestion</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ymMbABJw\">关键行为id的可投状态（投放建议）</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-85LdMjAY\">\n若返回以下投放建议，表示不建议选择该关键行为id进行投放，建议重新选择行为或检查回传链路</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-41BjgO5A\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-xCX594nE\">NOT_PRE_STANDARD 前置回传不足，建议在正式投放前完成3天以上优化行为事件回传，事件量大于500条</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-j76eWvYb\">ACTIVATION_LOW_BEHAVIOR_HIGH 行为转化率过低，行为付费率过高，建议重新选择行为或检查回传链路</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-KJGRWzl4\">ACTIVATION_LOW_BEHAVIOR_LOW 行为转化率过低，行为付费率过低，建议重新选择行为或检查回传链路</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-bN6j7bgj\">BEHAVIOR_ACTIVATION_LOW 行为转化率过低，建议重新选择行为或检查回传链路</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-CAwLghDA\">PAYMENT_ACTION_HIGH 行为付费率过高，建议重新选择行为或检查回传链路</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-IEe66qky\">PAYMENT_ACTION_LOW 行为付费率过低，建议重新选择行为或检查回传链路</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">request_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-5MytSZXF\">请求日志id</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-fECwPrXk\" id=\"h346b9f0-fECwPrXk\">应答示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22disabled%22%3Atrue%2C%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22HTTPS%2F1.1%20200%20OK%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22message%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22OK%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22code%5C%22%3A%200%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22data%5C%22%3A%20%7B%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u5BKP%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content json\"></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"qz-error-code_v2\" data-type=\"qzerrorcode\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201813040128339107%7D\">\n \n</div>\n</div>",
